#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-feedback.rst:5 0544e49564f64c249f8703244c596c11
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "反馈"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-feedback.rst:6 381812e6c8804807b743af95d960d259
msgid ""
"Sailing support is new to ArduRover and we need your feedback to continue "
"improving the code, join the discussion `here "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/sailboat-support/32060>`__ and let us know "
"how you got on!"
msgstr ""
"帆船支持是 ArduRover 的新功能，我们需要您的反馈来持续改进代码，请在 `此处 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/sailboat-support/32060>`__ 参与讨论，告诉我们您的使用情况！"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-feedback.rst:9 ca5f05f84962472ba10bf84781f00eca
msgid ""
"If you have found a bug or other issue with the code please fill in an issue"
" report `here <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/>`__."
msgstr ""
"若您发现代码中的错误或其他问题，请在 `此处 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/>`__ "
"填写问题报告。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-feedback.rst:11 ef5fa37cd14440248093f43af9a97e43
msgid "Happy Testing!"
msgstr "祝测试愉快！"
